WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.770
A typical menstrual cycle
lasts about 28 days.

2
00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:05.530
Real cycles vary.

3
00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:08.760
It begins as the lining
of the uterus is shed.

4
00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:11.830
Over the next days, the lining is rebuilt.

5
00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:16.970
Then, around day 14, a follicle
in the ovary releases an egg.

6
00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:18.080
Why then?

7
00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:21.400
Why in the middle, and not
at the start or the end?

8
00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:24.710
In this mission, you'll trace
hormones from the hypothalamus,

9
00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:28.320
to the pituitary, to the
ovary, and back again.

10
00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:33.200
Then you'll build the cycle day by day,
and see how each hormone changes the lining

11
00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:34.680
and the ovary.

12
00:00:34.730 --> 00:00:39.080
Your mission: explain why an egg is
released in the middle of the cycle.
